    <title>年终企划🍭I人「装E」混迹妙妙屋之2023年实录（含四首歌）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/656c8627f10bbce6356d695b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">656c8627f10bbce6356d695b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Dec 2023 13:44:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frk7uBFDk7PmV0yzv0PJtUE7aJly.jpg"></figure><p><strong><span>￡ 火象主播</span></strong><br><br><span>🎙值班：萌二♈️</span><br><strong><br><span>￡ 我的slogan</span></strong><br><br><span>不骄，不躁，不好为人师。</span><br><span>至诚，至性，愿感恩常在！</span><br><br><strong><span>￡ 听前の提示</span></strong><br><br><span>来啦(⊙ꇴ⊙)🎃</span><br><span>本次企划，是2023年底的年终特辑回顾节目——火象三傻妙妙屋の特供版，欢迎大家的围观和欣赏！！！！！！！！</span><br><br><span>播客推荐：</span><br><span>✅置顶播客：火象三傻妙妙屋</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60ed46f15294f153198c64ca" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60ed46f15294f153198c64ca"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><span>✅大仑丁的播客——仑流发言</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6484a2a8e68894365ddb53d4" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6484a2a8e68894365ddb53d4"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><span>✅夹心耶的播客——夹心树洞</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62f28f375e6447e88f6c5009" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62f28f375e6447e88f6c5009"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><span>✅延伸节目⬇️⬇️⬇️(^0^)⬇️⬇️⬇️</span></p><p><span>妙妙屋の第5期——</span></p><p><span>🔗李逍遥后来干嘛去了？火象三傻为您还原 《仙剑奇侠传》真相</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/611e1f3ddc0c485d9a0c97b2" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/611e1f3ddc0c485d9a0c97b2"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><span>妙妙屋の第42期——</span></p><p><span>🔗那些年我们磕过的CP！给爷锁死！</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/630451cbaa76db57c614fac0" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/630451cbaa76db57c614fac0"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><span>妙妙屋の第54期——</span></p><p><span>🔗想要抱起春节Mua的一口，再把Flag插满世界各地</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63c94f7a5ba41e008c952098" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63c94f7a5ba41e008c952098"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><span>妙妙屋の第66期——</span></p><p><span>🔗妙妙屋两周年，多亏了在座的各位！</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64ac2bfe9913f865879d9bc6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64ac2bfe9913f865879d9bc6"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><span>夹心树洞第01期——</span></p><p><span>🔗关于入坑播客的故事</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62f3549deb0492cf2f508584" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62f3549deb0492cf2f508584"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><span>仑流发言第12期——</span></p><p><span>🔗vol.012那些年的奇葩出行经历</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6539f660132c261b3a61d588" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6539f660132c261b3a61d588"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><strong><span>￡ 脑图＋时间轴</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsqx9HzPdU_oWkXFqgCuCc9hiCMJ.jpg"></figure><blockquote><p><strong><span>关键词1：造梗新尝试</span></strong></p></blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a> &nbsp;送给夹心的谐音梗：「夹速前进」VS「夹心树洞」🌳</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> &nbsp;哼哼♡我就是要拆开并重组罗宾的后宫，看我的「良心A货」组合。当然大仑丁&amp;三哥的「三轮车」也不能丢哇👭</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">02:06</a> &nbsp;感谢大家为我量身定制😘「鲁智深挠痒痒」的梗！！！！！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 别跑骚骚，你和萌仔都是唱《痒》的种子选手(° ꈊ °)</span></p><p></p><blockquote><p><strong><span>关键词2：生活歌唱家</span></strong></p></blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 作为专业乐团🌈扛把子的大仑丁/代老薯，快叫上你的兄弟姐妹，期待你们的《您抬举我》🎶</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="297">04:57</a> &nbsp;我就是一个普通的/爱唱歌的人，新年目标很简单：一直唱到明年的12月，以及感谢Frank和点点对本人清唱播客的支持📆</span></p><blockquote><p><strong><span>关键词3：星座观察员</span></strong></p></blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> &nbsp;三大风象の月亮星座，简称风象月座♒️♎️♊️</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="386">06:26</a> &nbsp;灵魂拷问の时刻——</span><br><span>▪️罗宾为什么说自己是一匹🐺「孤狼」呢？</span><br><span>▪️会不会是月亮水瓶的疏离和怪诞在作祟嘞？</span><br><span>▪️这个「孤狼」和Last dance有甚么关系？</span><br><span>▪️三哥的外号为什么叫😚社交悍匪？</span><br><span>▪️嚯～莫非是因为拓展交际圈，其实是三哥🤘月亮天秤の自我充电的方式？</span><br><span>▪️萌二虽然自称I人🤣可为何却像一个大E呢？</span><br><span>▪️是因为TA的月亮双子有点子反应快，和能言善道吗？</span><br><span>（PS：周伯通的左右互搏术，本月双子不要太爱惹✨)</span><br><br><span>番外：特别鸣谢活动担当萌仔，啾咪啾咪😙另外，吃饭就选祺记或Q记，粤语还得听J律和川的演绎(≧∇≦)</span><br><br><br><span>小结：四首歌の时间与歌词^ω^</span><br><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a> 🐗《好汉歌》</span><br><br><span>大河向东流哇</span><br><span>天上的星星参北斗哇</span><br><span>说走咱就走哇</span><br><span>你有我有全都有哇</span><br><span>（哎咿呀部分，随机表现^ω^）</span><br><span>路见不平一声吼哇</span><br><span>该出手时就出手哇</span><br><span>风风火火闯九洲哇</span><br><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">03:21</a> 🤘《痒》</span><br><br><span>来啊 快活啊 反正有大把时光</span><br><span>来啊 爱情啊 反正有大把愚妄</span><br><span>来啊 流浪啊 反正有大把方向</span><br><span>来啊 造作啊 反正有大把风光</span><br><span>啊 痒</span><br><span>大大方方 爱上爱的表象</span><br><span>迂迂回回 迷上梦的孟浪</span><br><span>越慌越想越慌 越痒越搔越痒</span><br><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">07:25</a> 🚢《Young and beautiful》</span><br><br><span>Will you still love me</span><br><span>When I'm no longer young and beautiful?</span><br><span>Will you still love me</span><br><span>When I got nothing but my aching soul?</span><br><span>I know you will, I know you will</span><br><span>I know that you will</span><br><span>Will you still love me when I'm no longer beautiful?</span><br><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">08:05</a> 🐺《杀破狼》</span><br><br><span>生是为了证明</span><br><span>爱存在的痕迹</span><br><span>火燃烧后更伟大的生命</span><br><span>杀是为了歌颂</span><br><span>破灭前的壮丽</span><br><span>夜是狼深邃眼睛</span><br><span>孤独等待黎明</span><br><span>嘿呀嘿呀嘿呀～</span><br><strong><br><span>￡ Song list</span></strong><br><span>💠插曲：</span><br><span>①好汉歌 -刘欢</span><br><span>②痒 -黄龄</span><br><span>③Young And Beautiful -Lana Del Rey</span><br><span>④杀破狼- JS</span><br><span>💠OP： </span><br><span>⑤喜庆节日古风 -Cyber Ants</span><br><span>💠ED： </span><br><span>⑥恭喜恭喜 -中国娃娃</span><br><br><strong><span>￡ 投喂鼓励</span></strong><br><br><span>步骤一：截图或长按下方二维码，存入相册；</span><br><br><span>步骤二：爱发电调出扫一扫的相册，识别一下；</span><br><br><span>步骤三：方便的话，打赏的同时，不妨留言或备注一下心动的歌曲哦；</span><br><br><span>步骤四：没有了啦，哈哈哈哈哈～其实我本身不是一个能够坦然谈钱的人，但还是本着体验为上的心态，开始创造独属于自己和金钱的精神连接。</span><strong><span>希望金额不单纯指向一串冷冰冰的数字，而是承载着一份充满温度的价值反馈。</span></strong><br><br><span>最后，大家随意就好，而我要系上安全带，开启和金钱的长征之旅呐👇👇👇</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsj6HBf_1n4bzzRw8WJpebjbRvVn.jpg"></figure><p><strong><span>￡ 更多创作</span></strong><br><br><span>🌏我的播客笔记📝尽在——</span><br><em><br><span>【萌二的书写疗愈】</span></em><br><br><span>🍠红书号：<a data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c52a4f9000000001b0059b2?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c52a4f9000000001b0059b2&amp;apptime=1666160707" href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c52a4f9000000001b0059b2?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c52a4f9000000001b0059b2&amp;apptime=1666160707">www.xiaohongshu.com</a></span><br><span>🧣微博号：<a data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6507689505" href="https://weibo.com/u/6507689505">weibo.com</a></span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoFIsN4umGKB2Y3yjcDu_gzlpolZ.jpg"></figure><ul><li><p><span>播客清单 (˘❥˘)</span></p></li><li><p><span>红书版🦊12篇</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmNFjP_8eEtzMn6tfM1NswWbVcCi.jpg"></figure><ul><li><p><span>播客清单 (•̀⌓•́)</span></p></li><li><p><span>微博版🐼13篇</span></p></li></ul>]]></description>
