    <title>六一特辑★天蝎♏️和白羊♈的奇妙友情｜萌二SOLO⚛湿货</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64782ce316726282409e6760</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64782ce316726282409e6760</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 01 Jun 2023 05:30:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frk7uBFDk7PmV0yzv0PJtUE7aJly.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>￡ 火象主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🎙值班：萌二♈️</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>￡ 我的slogan</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>不骄，不躁，不好为人师。</span></p><span></span><p><span>至诚，至性，愿感恩常在！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>￡ 听前の提示</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>🔽🔽👇🔽🔽</span><br><span> </span><em><span>哦莫(≖‿≖)✧！</span><br><span>真的是，没有想到哇——</span><br><span> </span><br><span>有一天，我这个超级社恐，</span><br><span>竟有跟大家扯闲天的时候。</span><br><span> </span><br><span>当然，按我本人的步调，是一定会等到一个非(hui)常合适的时机，也就是等待灵感触发大脑的时刻，任由创意以任何意料之外的方式，出现^ω^</span><br><span> </span><br><span>萌二的SOLO，自然也跑不脱，</span><br><span>会这样奇怪地和大家见面！！！</span><br><span> </span><br><span>本次企划，是六一儿童节的青春友谊回顾节目。契机来自我常听的一档播客【火象三傻妙妙屋】狗子团🐩友情主题的延伸。</span><br><span> </span><br><span>在这里，我将为大家讲述，白羊座和天蝎座女孩之间的友谊。</span><br><span> </span><br><span>本期播客也将以声音信件的形式，发送到小妙屋的邮箱。</span><br><span> </span><br><span>故而，这是萌二的去信💌</span><br><span>也是萌二的SOLO。</span></em></blockquote><span></span><p><span>注：关于狗子团的相关链接，在下面：</span><br><span> </span><br><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61370308f9d649e840681bcb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61370308f9d649e840681bcb"><span>07.如何和好朋友共谋一场”不分手“的旅行——狗子团的乡村温泉7日游</span></a><br><span> </span><br><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/634498c7cd655d55788d6b5b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/634498c7cd655d55788d6b5b"><span>45.集合啦狗子团！排除万难也要一起去旅行</span></a><br><span> </span><br><span>另：因为历经的时间久远，可能存在一些记忆的错漏，所以今天的播客可以当作故事来听，放松开心最重要啦！第一次做SOLO和timeline，有点紧张，也有些兴奋，哦吼吼吼 \^O^/</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>￡ 脑图＋时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fms71nlivIinlyrsLmGTk542_wQt.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Part 1：天蝎座的竞，我的小学好友</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> &nbsp;竞的兴趣爱好，真心不要太多喔！！！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 竞参加合唱团，拓宽了我们的朋友圈✪ω✪</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="171">02:51</a> &nbsp;白羊座♈️我，想要跟竞♏️说的话……</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Part 2：天蝎座的妞，我的高中学妹</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="204">03:24</a> 我和妞的缘分起点，陌生人的串门社交。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="223">03:43</a> 有什么不舒服的点，倾向于直言不讳的妞ฅ( ˆꈊˆ )</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="252">04:12</a> &nbsp;白羊座♈️我，愿意告诉妞♏️的话……</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>结尾：唱一丢丢应景的《孤勇者》🤘</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> &nbsp;搭配歌词，收听更香^O^</span><br><span> </span><br><span>爱你孤身走暗巷</span><br><span>爱你不跪的模样</span><br><span>爱你对峙过绝望</span><br><span>不肯哭一场😂</span><br><span> </span><br><span>爱你破烂的衣裳</span><br><span>却敢堵命运的枪</span><br><span>爱你和我那么像</span><br><span>缺口都一样👺</span><br><span> </span><br><span>去吗 配吗 这褴褛的披风</span><br><span>战吗 战啊 以最卑微的梦</span><br><span> </span><br><span>致那黑夜中的呜咽与怒吼</span><br><span>谁说站在光里的才算英雄</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>￡ 文稿参考</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/li38IhUNthDe0ojFtW6tZFH17QhF.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>▪BGM▪</span><br><span>① Clearing Up -菅野祐悟</span><br><span>② 嬉しい再会 -吉俣良</span><br><span>③ 孤勇者 (钢琴班) -oskarpianist</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>￡ 投喂鼓励</span></strong><br><span> </span><br><span>步骤一：截图或长按下方二维码，存入相册；</span><br><span> </span><br><span>步骤二：爱发电调出扫一扫的相册，识别一下；</span><br><span> </span><br><span>步骤三：方便的话，打赏的同时，不妨留言或简单地备注一下，你对本二这次SOLO的感想；</span><br><span> </span><br><span>步骤四：没有了啦，哈哈哈哈哈～其实我本身不是一个能够坦然谈钱的人，但还是本着体验为上的心态，开始创造独属于自己和金钱的精神连接。</span><strong><span>希望金额不单纯指向一串冷冰冰的数字，而是承载着一份充满温度的价值反馈。</span><br><span> </span></strong><br><span>最后，大家随意就好，而我要系上安全带，开启和金钱的长征之旅呐👇👇👇</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsj6HBf_1n4bzzRw8WJpebjbRvVn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>￡ 更多创作</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🌐我的播客笔记📝尽在——</span><br><span> </span><br><span> </span><em><span>【萌二的书写疗愈】</span></em><strong><br><span> </span><br><span>🍠红书号：<a data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c52a4f9000000001b0059b2?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c52a4f9000000001b0059b2&amp;apptime=1666160707" href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c52a4f9000000001b0059b2?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c52a4f9000000001b0059b2&amp;apptime=1666160707">www.xiaohongshu.com</a></span><br><span>🧣微博号：<a data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6507689505" href="https://weibo.com/u/6507689505">weibo.com</a></span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoFIsN4umGKB2Y3yjcDu_gzlpolZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>播客清单(●˙▾˙●)</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>红书版 🍭 12篇</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmNFjP_8eEtzMn6tfM1NswWbVcCi.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>播客清单( ੭•͈ω•͈)੭</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>微博版 🎨 13篇</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
